  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="12">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northleoda">Norðleod.</ref> 12</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif hi þæt nabbað, ne to ðam geþeon ne magon, gilde man cirlisce.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if they have it not, and cannot prosper sufficiently, one is to pay at the ceorl's rate.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 gif hig þæt nabbað, ne to þam geþeon ne magan, gylde man cyrlisce.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">And if they do not have it and cannot acquire enough, their compensation will be that of a layman.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
